# Service-account keys must never enter the image. Beyond the obvious — a private
# key baked into every layer — a key file here silently WINS over ADC in
# init_firebase(), which is how the backend ended up writing to a different
# Firebase project than the browser reads. On Cloud Run the runtime service
# account is the credential; nothing needs to be shipped.
serviceAccountKey.json
gcp-service-account.json
client_secret.json
